*“Curse you, Perry the Platypus!”*

**All bugs** are introduced by Doofenshmirtz and one of his ridiculous "-inators", each representing a common dev failure or sabotage (listed below).

---

## 🛠️ COMMON "-INATORS" (Bug Types)

| Inator Name                | Represents                         |
|----------------------------|-------------------------------------|
| **Bug-ifier-inator**         | General runtime errors             |
| **Loopinator**              | Infinite loop or stack overflow     |
| **RaceCondition-inator**    | Async timing issues                 |
| **Obfuscation-inator**      | Minified code or poor naming        |
| **Lintinator**              | Exploded lint rules / pre-commit    |
| **Regression-inator**       | Reintroduced old bugs               |
| **Timeoutinator**           | Server timeout, retry overflow      |
| **404inator**               | Broken links, missing resources     |
| **Mutatorinator**           | Uncontrolled state mutation         |

