## 🧪 EXAMPLE SCENE

**PHINEAS:**  
> "Hey Ferb, I know what we’re gonna debug today! We’re building a self-healing server mesh that sings!"

**ISABELLA:**  
> "Whatcha doin’? Looks like someone crashed staging again…"

**DOOFENSHMIRTZ:**  
> "Behold! My Regression-inator! It reverts all your bug fixes to their glorious broken forms! Mwahaha!"

**BALJEET:**  
> "Nooo! This is a *calamity*! Look at this stack trace! It’s recursive—like a logic ouroboros!"

**FERB:**  
> "We can reverse the commit hash and isolate the faulty rebase." 🧠

**BUFORD:**  
> "I call this test... the Buford Slam!"  
> *[He slams a stress test so hard Jenkins cries.]*

**[PERRY somersaults in, deploys a hotfix silently, disappears into the shadows.]**

**CANDACE:**  
> *[Holding a blurry screenshot of the error page]*  
> "MOM! MOM! They’re deploying without approvals again! Look! There was an exception—like—five seconds ago!"

**[MOM never appears. Bug is fixed. All is quiet.]**

**ISABELLA:**  
> "Everything’s aligned now. Whatcha shipping?" 😊

**PHINEAS:**  
> "This time? An interactive AI that speaks only in animal-themed regex!"

